000100 IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
000200 PROGRAM-ID. RPTRAW.
000300* A report file as a data set: RECFM=FA, 133 bytes -- the ASA
000400* byte and 132 columns, as IKFCBL00 writes it. The report is read
000500* back through a second FD of exactly that length, so a record
000600* one byte long (as a mistake once made them, with a stray X'00'
000700* at the end) fails the read instead of passing unseen. Each
000800* record shows its control byte, the start of its text, and
000900* whether its last column is a space.
001000 ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
001100 INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
001200 FILE-CONTROL.
001300     SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-PROUT.
001400     SELECT RAW-FILE ASSIGN TO UT-S-PROUT.
001500 DATA DIVISION.
001600 FILE SECTION.
001700 FD  PRINT-FILE
001800     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED
001900     REPORT IS RAW-RPT.
002000 FD  RAW-FILE
002100     LABEL RECORDS ARE OMITTED.
002200 01  RAW-REC.
002300     05  R-CTL    PIC X.
002400     05  R-TEXT   PIC X(20).
002500     05  FILLER   PIC X(111).
002600     05  R-LAST   PIC X.
002700 WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
002800 01  WS-IDX   PIC 99 VALUE 0.
002900 01  EOF      PIC X VALUE 'N'.
003000 01  SEQ      PIC 99 VALUE 0.
003100 REPORT SECTION.
003200 RD  RAW-RPT
003300     PAGE LIMIT IS 12 LINES
003400     HEADING 1
003500     FIRST DETAIL 3
003600     LAST DETAIL 10.
003700 01  PAGE-HEAD TYPE PH LINE 1.
003800     05  COLUMN 1   PIC X(8)  VALUE 'RAW HEAD'.
003900     05  COLUMN 132 PIC X     VALUE 'E'.
004000 01  DL TYPE DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
004100     05  COLUMN 1   PIC X(4)  VALUE 'ITEM'.
004200     05  COLUMN 6   PIC 99    SOURCE WS-IDX.
004300 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
004400 MAIN-PARA.
004500     OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE.
004600     INITIATE RAW-RPT.
004700     PERFORM GEN VARYING WS-IDX FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-IDX > 3.
004800     TERMINATE RAW-RPT.
004900     CLOSE PRINT-FILE.
005000     OPEN INPUT RAW-FILE.
005100     PERFORM SHOW-ONE UNTIL EOF = 'Y'.
005200     CLOSE RAW-FILE.
005300     DISPLAY 'RECORDS ' SEQ.
005400     STOP RUN.
005500 GEN.
005600     GENERATE DL.
005700 SHOW-ONE.
005800     READ RAW-FILE AT END MOVE 'Y' TO EOF.
005900     IF EOF NOT = 'Y'
006000         ADD 1 TO SEQ
006100         IF R-LAST = SPACE
006200             DISPLAY SEQ ' [' R-CTL '] ' R-TEXT ' BLANK'
006300         ELSE DISPLAY SEQ ' [' R-CTL '] ' R-TEXT ' [' R-LAST ']'.
